window.products.push({"id":211032,"name":"LIFEREVO Luxury Pom Poms Velvet Bed Skirt, Velvet Wrap Around Bed Skirt, Diamond Quilted Fitted Bed Sheet with Bedskirt, 18 Inch Drop Dust Ruffle Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817H8f5PZ3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester Imported ALL IN ONE DESIGN: This soft velvet bed skirt includes a wrap-around bed skirt and a quilted fitted bed sheet, all in one. You can sleep directly on it as the high-quality velvet material feels soft and smooth against your skin. It's easy to install with elastic bands on the corners that better hold the velvet bed skirt and sheet over your mattress. It can also been used as a decorative bedspread. SIZE: The white velvet bed skirt comes in the following sizes: Twin/Twin XL (39\"x75\"x18\"), Full/Queen (60\"x80\"x18\"), and King (78\"x80\"x18\"). With an 18-inch drop, the pom poms bed skirt can hide everything under your bed for a neat and crisp look. Additionally, we offer matching fluffy duvet cover sets, fuzzy pillowcases, cute throw pillows, and plush body pillow covers that are sold separately. You can mix and match them to create a charming bed style. QUILTED FITTED BED SHEET: The velvet fitted bed sheet features a quilted design with 120gsm no glue microfiber filling, making it comfortable to rest your face against. Its stylish and classic diamond pattern adds a touch of luxury and elegance to your bedroom decor. Moreover, the sheet/bed skirt has passed the OEKO-TEX certification, indicating that it is skin-friendly, pet-friendly, and resistant to fading, shedding, and pilling. POM POMS BED SKIRT: The pom-pom wrap around bed skirt is a charming addition to any bedroom. The elastic velvet bed skirt features decorative white pom poms around the bottom edges, adding a touch of cuteness, fun, and style to your bedding. The little balls are sewn with excellent workmanship and are durable enough to withstand frequent use. They are a perfect complement to your overall bedroom decor and create a cozy, playful atmosphere. CARE & SERVICE: When caring for this quilted sheet/bed skirt, machine wash it on a gentle cycle using cold water. Tumble dry on low and avoid using heat. Do not bleach or iron it. At LIFEREVO, we value your satisfaction and appreciate your love for our products. That's why we offer lifetime customer service to ensure your happiness with your purchase. If you have any questions or concerns regarding this fringe fitted bed skirt, please don't hesitate to contact us for a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817H8f5PZ3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFEREVO","source_asin":"B076LQ9VRC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076LQ9VRC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076LQ9VRC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
