window.products.push({"id":211213,"name":"HealthGoodsIn Pure Copper Hammered Thermos Bottle for Ayurvedic Benefits, 900 ML (30.4 FL OZ.), UNLINED, UNCOATED","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ngW+WqZ1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ayurveda recommends a simple, practical and effective method of drinking water in its most holistic way - drinking water from a copper vessel. To make copper water, pour water in the copper vessel and leave it overnight. Drink it as soon as you get up in the morning. You can also use your copper cup to drink water from it at all times. It's recommended to drink the water at room temperature. The copper vessel should not be stored in fridge. Copper darkens naturally over a period of time. The copper vessel requires cleaning from time to time. Use lemon juice or tamarind to rub the utensils. Leave it for few minutes and wash with water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ngW+WqZ1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HealthGoodsIn","source_asin":"B07NVCDZGG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NVCDZGG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NVCDZGG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":211214,"name":"Acid Tactical® 4PK Camouflage Spray Paint Camo Gun Stencils Adhesive & Mylar Assorted Skulls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812qbRc7vDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Acid Tactical Spray painting Stencils COMBO PACK - Adhesive Punish Skulls & 3 sheets Mylar Asst. Skulls Punish SKULL are Easy Peel - Stick on, Paint, Peel Off  4 stencils as shown in our main image.  Designed for use on Rifles, Shotguns, Pistols. Can be used on Plastic, Metal, Wood, etc..  .25mm Vinyl Sheets & .3mm Mylar Sheets  Can be used with all types of paints including, Rattle can, Duracoat, Cerakote, water, and oil based paints. ADHESIVE STENCILS  Our adhesive easy peel stencils will not leave sticky glue residue behind. They were designed to remove cleanly and not effect the paint.  Stencils are heat resistant on both metal and polymers. They do not shrink on ABS and Polymers when flash curing like the yellow avery paper. They leave little to no adhesive behind so no messy clean up.  For angled surfaces: When shaping around corners use larger stickers and allow half of the sticker to lay on each plane. If small sections of the design overlaps a corner it may not adhere well. Use scissors to trim any excess that doesn't want to adhere Useful Tools:  Exacto knife - Can be used to remove sticker and also to form sticker in tight angles. Scissors - To trim excess stencil  MYLAR STENCILS  Mylar stencils are spray through type. You can use a whole sheet at one time or isolate a single skull using scrap paper and masking tape. This type of stencil is reusable and washable.  What you get. 4 - 9x14\" Sheets - 1 Adhesive Punisher skulls sheet and 3 spray through Mylar assorted skull sheets.  Each sheet is a unique design. Specifications: Material: Adhesive - High Temp Vinyl film Spray through - Mylar Thickness: .25mm / .30mm Length: 14\" Width: 9\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812qbRc7vDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Acid Tactical","source_asin":"B07D64X9ZF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D64X9ZF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D64X9ZF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
