window.products.push({"id":211227,"name":"Building Blocks Bricks Party Favor Bags Made From Recycled Paper // 10 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616G2IEY88L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Tumbler color - BLACK Our Black color Tumbler Mug has a modern design with a surface that has a pleasant tactile sensation to it, making it comfortable and convenient to hold. This mug was simply designed to be a life-long travel buddy. Our goal is to produce quality tumblers with a simple and smart design. We strive to satisfy your needs with the range of our quality products, which include insulated tumblers, bottles, cups and thermoses. You’ll be sure to ENJOY A CLEAN AND FRESH TASTE of your favorite drink from OUR stainless steel tumblers. No matter what climate you’re traveling in, our Tumblers are sure to contain the heat of your hot drink on your alpine hiking trips in the mountains or the keep your cold drink cool on your Sahara desert expeditions. Our Tumbler Mug was designed for: -Casual road trips -Hiking or backpacking trips -Hot days on the beach -Alpine hiking on snowy mountains -Also great for just drinking water -Your favorite smoothies -Mothers feeding their kids Our Tumbler Mugs were designed with the following features: - Designed with split proof lid that can be opened with one finger (The split proof lid is sealed with silicone keeping it air tight) - Lid is made with a durable plastic Our Tumbler Mugs have great additional features for keeping your life simple: -Designed with a hole on the magnetic lid, making sipping or fitting straws in convenient -Designed to fit any cup holder in your car Technological Features of our Tumbler Mugs include: - Designed to keep hot beverages hot for up to 6 hours - Designed to keep cold drinks cool for up 24 hours - Made with SEAMLESS Inner and outer DESIGN - Made from a DURABLE STAINLESS STEEL 18/8 - Produces no condensation - Made BPA free and from a non-toxic material, which is eco-friendly - Designed with a durable scratch proof Powder coating - Dishwash safe Dimensions: Diameter of lid: 3 1/2 inches Height: 6 7/8 inches Diameter of bottom: 6 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616G2IEY88L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Think Green Fun:wave","source_asin":"B07H5TYDQH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H5TYDQH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H5TYDQH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":211228,"name":"Large Wooden Cutting Board - Reversible Maple Wood Butcher Block With Juice Groove Made in the USA by California Custom Millwork (20x15x1.25)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dafk-IRsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A BUTCHER'S BLOCK FROM CALIFORNIA CUSTOM MILLWORK IS A NECESSITY FOR EVERY KITCHEN Not only do our cutting boards have an elegant, natural look, they also add to the character of the food that’s prepared because they acquire a good seasoning over time, much in the same way cast iron cookware does. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE KNOWING OUR PRODUCTS ARE PROUDLY MADE IN THE USA While cheaper bamboo and acacia cutting boards are mass-produced and imported from China, California Custom Millwork uses only the best maple wood grown in the USA for its cutting boards and butcher blocks. USE WHAT PROFESSIONAL CHEFS EVERYWHERE USE Maple cutting boards are used in restaurants around the world because they’re more durable than bamboo and won’t ruin expensive knives like plastic. DURABLE DESIGN IS EASY TO CLEAN Your Butcher Block comes pre-treated with a food-safe mineral oil so it’s ready to go right out of the box. When you’re finished using it, simply rinse off thoroughly and towel dry any excess liquid. Use a sponge and mild soap to scrub away stubborn particles. YOU WILL NEED TO TREAT YOUR NEW BUTCHER BLOCK REGULARLY Liberally apply a food-safe mineral oil to your clean board by hand or with a rag, wiping off the excess after an hour or so. This will prevent the board from absorbing water and warping. It is EXTREMELY IMPORTANT that you take these measures to ensure that your cutting board lasts a lifetime. MAKES THE PERFECT GIFT Whether you need a gift for a housewarming, wedding, birthday or any other special occasion, a chopping block from California Custom Millwork is a great choice. CLICK ADD TO CART TO GET YOURS TODAY! NEVER PUT YOUR CUTTING BOARD IN THE DISHWASHER * Every California Custom Millwork cutting board is handmade from maple wood and therefore may not look exactly like the product photos","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dafk-IRsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tapleap","source_asin":"B06XGQMW9H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XGQMW9H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XGQMW9H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":211229,"name":"OXO Good Grips 6 Piece Large Canister Set with Scoops, 4.4 qt each, White & Good Grips 3-PC Small Square Short POP Container Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":88.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dR5iyVmbL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"OXO Good Grips 6 Piece Large Canister Set with Scoops, 4.4 qt each, WhiteWhen it comes to keeping bulk food fresh and close at hand, The OXO good grips two-piece pop container bulk set is a game changer. Airtight, stackable, space-efficient, and now completely dishwasher safe, These containers can be customized to fit any space. Three 4.4 Qt containers are perfect for storing family-sized staples like 5 lb Bags of flour, sugar staples, while the three convenient ½ cup scoops make measuring and serving a cinch. With a handy fill line to guide you, curved corners for smooth dispensing and sturdy, BPA-free construction pop containers take tidying to the next level. Pop containers aren't just for kitchens: use them any place you want more organization. Set includes: three 4.4 Qt containers ideal for storing 5 lb Bags of flour, sugar and other economy-sized staples, and three handy ½ cup scoops that neatly attach to the underside of pop container lids. Other POP accessories sold separately.OXO Good Grips 3-PC Small Square Short POP Container SetThe OXO good grips two-piece pop container value set is the key to keeping dry foods fresh and countertops clutter-free. Airtight, stackable, space-efficient, and now completely dishwasher safe, These containers can be customized to fit any space. This three-piece set is perfectly calibrated for kitchen essentials like 1 lb boxes or bags or brown sugar, coffee, tea and snacks. With a handy fill line to guide you, curved corners for smooth dispensing and sturdy, BPA-free construction pop containers take tidying to the next level. Pop containers aren't just for kitchens: use them any place you want more organization. Set includes: three 1.1 Qt containers ideal for 1 lb of brown or confectionery sugar, tea and snacks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dR5iyVmbL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B09SGJB7R6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SGJB7R6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SGJB7R6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
