window.products.push({"id":211243,"name":"Zentron Crystal Collection: Natural Clear Quartz Points Stones 1\"-2.5\" with Velvet Bag (1 Pound)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SL3GI84JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Clear Quartz points are naturally formed stones. They are one of many forms of quartz and are found all over the world. Quartz is actually the second most abundant mineral on Earth. All quartz points are 6 sided which comes from there chemical structure. In ancient times a few civilizations beleived clear quartz was super frozen ice. Some believe quartz to have healing powers and ability to heighten energy. This has not been proven scientifically however quartz is used for Piezoelectricity. Each Zentron branded rough stone lot comes from all natural crystal and comes with a velvet carrying pouch and a Zentron rock information sheet. Each stone lot will have a slightly different appearance due to the uniqueness of the rock from which it is cut.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SL3GI84JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zentron","source_asin":"B08KTTVT33","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KTTVT33","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KTTVT33","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":211244,"name":"CRAZYBELLY 1 Pair Shower Curtain Rod Holder for Bathroom Self-Adhesive Tension Shower Curtain Rod Brackets No Drilling on Smooth Surface(White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XlyWCltHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤Nice Design: These shower curtain rod holders are specially designed for tension shower curtain rods. They are made of durable ABS material and have both self-adhesive foam sticker and screw hole on it. You can choose to use stickers on those smooth surfaces and screws in those rough surfaces. ❤Fits for the Most Tension Shower Curtain Rod Ends: The curtain rod holder can support up to 2.7\" / 6.9 cm diameter curtain rod ends. The most common rubber ends of tension shower curtain rods are 1.4\" - 2.5\" in diameter. ❤Strong Adhesive: The back stickers are very sticky dual-side foam sticker The dual-side foam stickers are sticky enough to make the rod holder to hold up to 20 Lb weight. The moisture in the air from showering will not loosen it. ❤Easy to Install on the Smooth Surfaces: There is no need to drill holes in the wall. 1. Mark the place you want to install, 2. Clean the surface, 3. Peel off the backing paper of the dual-side foam sticker and paste it in the right place on the wall. ❤Self-Adhesive & Screw-Fixed For All Surfaces: For the most common bathroom wall surface such as tile, painted wall, glass, wallpaper, just use self-adhesive sticker to fix. For the rough wall surface such as wood board, cement wall, brick wall, please use Screws and Anchors (included) to fix.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XlyWCltHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CRAZYBELLY","source_asin":"B0946JNP4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0946JNP4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0946JNP4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":211245,"name":"Duralex - Ramekin Clear Bowl 8,5 cm (3 3/8\") Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G5VTjDSYL._AC_SL1123_.jpg","description":"Founded in 1929, Duralex has been manufacturing glassware and tabletop products in La Chapelle-Saint-Mesmin, a city in the heart of France. Since 1939, when Duralex invented the glass tempering process, the name Duralex has been associated with resilient glassware, thanks to their proprietary tempering process. The Duralex glass is the perfect weight, functional yet stylish and feels extremely comfortable in the hand. They are equally suitable for cold or hot drinks, conveniently stackable, impact and chip resistant, microwave and dishwasher safe. With the help of continuous investments and commitment to quality, Duralex has reached a level of excellence that makes its products recognized throughout the world. Duralex is and will always remain a true French manufacturer of glassware and tabletop products, and is the only glass manufacturer that makes 100 percent of their products in France.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61G5VTjDSYL._AC_SL1123_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duralex","source_asin":"B00F9IMCMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F9IMCMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F9IMCMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
