window.products.push({"id":211272,"name":"Lunch Tote Bag & Reusable Sandwich Bag Bundle - Double Compartment Lunch Tote and snack Ziploc Bag - Food Grade Quality -Insulated Lunch Box for Kids ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jUA8SvkyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏆 PREVENT LEAKS AND KEEP YOUR FOOD FRESH- Lunch Tote’s lunch bag will change the way you pack your lunch forever. The lunch bag is made from high-quality scratch resistant fabric and is polyester lined with environmentally friendly PEVA material. Waterproof, BPA free and made of food grade materials. Will keep your food fresh and intact. 🍽️ DUAL COMPARTMENT INSULATED LUNCH TOTE- Our lunch bag has 2 compartments that allow you to hold hot food on one side and cold food on the other. The compartments will keep food cold or hot for up to 6 hours with the most advanced insulation technology on the market. Keep beverage cold on one side and food warm on the other. Perfect for long days outdoors. 🔶 MULTI PURPOSE MEDIUM SIZED LUNCH BAG- The lunch bag can be re-purposed to store breast milk, be used for hunting and hiking trips, as a gym bag, for office or work use, as a portable baby caddy with diapers, cloths, and milk, as a kids lunch box for school, and as a car caddy for long road trips. Travel at ease and enjoy life worry-free, with our multi-purpose lunch bag. 💎FREE ZIPPERED FOOD POUCH INCLUDED- Size: 7 inches by 7 Inches - Stop spending money on plastic Ziplock bags. The re-usable zipper bag is leak-proof, easy to clean, and stylish. Made of high-grade, food-safe PEVA lining to keep your food fresher for longer. Non-toxic, and BPA-free, re-purpose the zipper bag for accessories, pencils, medication, baby accessories, toiletry bag, makeup bag and more. 🏁 YOUR SATISFACTION IS OUR #1 PRIORITY- We created this bundle from the eco-friendliest advanced materials in the market to give you the best experience possible. We’re sure you’re going to love this bundle. If you’re not 100% satisfied, we will provide you with a full refund or a free exchange, no questions asked. We offer a 30-day warranty, contact us directly, and we will gladly assist! We Give A Portion Of Our Proceeds To Charities - U.S. Veterans & Saving The Environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jUA8SvkyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lunch tote","source_asin":"B07R74PRTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R74PRTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R74PRTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
