window.products.push({"id":211533,"name":"Vextronic Collapsible Storage Bins, Fabric Storage Baskets for Shelves, Canvas Decorative Storage Bins with Handles, Foldable Storage Baskets for Orga","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C47hdXAfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Fabric Storage Bin with Handles】 The storage basket is made of 2.5mm durable extra thick linen cationic fabric (outer layer) and polyester (inner layer), while the top is supported by a metal frame, making it extremely durable and sturdy. The sides of the storage bin are leather handles reinforced with rivets, making it easy to pull the storage baskets from the shelf and lift it when moving. 【Collapsible Storage Bins】 The storage baskets for shelves is a collapsible design, just fold the storage bins for shelves down and lay flat to save space when not in use or need to be transported. 【Multi-purpose & Suitable for Various Scenes】 Storage baskets for organizing can meet a variety of storage needs in daily life, such as storing clothes, children's toys, pet supplies (dog toys) and books, etc., keeping your space beautiful, neat and organized. At the same time, the decorative storage bins is suitable for a variety of scenarios, can be used for living room, study room, office, bedroom, kitchen, bathroom and closet storage, etc. 【Easy to Clean】 The canvas storage bin is easy to clean, just wipe with a damp sponge or cloth, spot clean with light soapy water when needed, not machine washable. 【Rectangle Storage Basket】 Dimension(each): 13.5(L) x 9.0(H) x 8.5(W) inches, set of 3 large storage bins. Tips: Due to the compressed packaging, the foldable storage bin may be a little wrinkled, it is best to use a steam iron or hair dryer to smooth it before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C47hdXAfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vextronic","source_asin":"B08NSYP4Y5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NSYP4Y5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NSYP4Y5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":211534,"name":"Sted Minky Dot Weighted Blanket 20 lbs for Adult, Sherpa Breathable Fuzzy Ultra-Soft Fluffy Weighted Blanket for Sleep,Individual Use, Purple 60\"×80\" ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":80.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z-FfJxm-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Top-grade Minky Dots Weighted Blanket: Using 2 in 1 technology features raised 3D dots that feel like light pats and strokes on the skin .sewn up with ultra-soft Sherpa fleece to keep comfy and warm. Sturdy 7 layer structure is built to last. Excellent Experience: We designed various versions of blankets to cater to users of different weight. Ceramic beads sewn in solid small pockets and firmly cushioned under polyester layers provide even dispersion without spills, so the blanket snugly conforms to the body without any heavy or stuffy feel, you’ll feel breezy like cuddles and instantly drift off to sweet dreamland. Use Anywhere: Premium weighted blanket is not only used as a cover in bed, it’s also your sweetest pal when you are reading, watching TV. It makes a perfect gift for lovers, friends, kids, parents on birthdays, Christmas, Thanksgiving or anniversaries, believe us, it’ll be a huge surprise. Weight Selection: Choose a blanket that weighs about 8% - 12% of your body weight. We recommend 15 lbs blanket for 125 lbs - 170 lbs users, and 20 lbs for 170 lbs - 250 lbs users, or you can choose a blanket to your preference. If it’s the first time you use a weighted blanket, start with a lighter one so you can better adapt to the weight. Easy Care and Comprehensive Customer Service: No worries about caring the blanket. Spot clean for local stain. If you are to clean the thoroughly blanket, wash in a commercial machine and tumble dry low. In any case you are not happy with our product, please do contact us and we will respond within 24 hours, your satisfaction guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z-FfJxm-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sted","source_asin":"B095YCCLCP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095YCCLCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095YCCLCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
