window.products.push({"id":211996,"name":"Inflatable Travel Pillow, Kimiandy Travel Essentials for Kids & Adults,Airplane Footrest Can Be Adjustable Height,Leg Rest Airplane Pillow for Travel/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618DS3ygHEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AIRPLANE TRAVEL ESSENTIALS This Portable Inflatable Travel Pillow Helps Prevent Low Back Pain, Stiffness And Leg Swelling  During Long Flights And Sitting, Relieves Work Stress And Improves Blood Circulation, Helping You Enjoy a Relaxing Flight And a Comfortable Working Time. Also Great For Travelling With Babies And Toddlers, Long Trips Can Be Problematic For Little Ones  Who Need a Nap. This Travel Pillow - foot rest for airplane travel Is Designed To Fit Between The  Front And Rear Car Seats To Create a Place To Lie Down. ADVANTAGE: 1.2 IN 1 DOUBLE AIR VALVE : Compared With The Traditional Inflatable Footrest Pillow, This  Pillow Uses a 2-In-1 Air Valve, Which Is More Effective In Preventing Air Leakage, And The  Efficiency Of Inflation And Deflation Is Also Greatly Increased. 2.ADJUSTABLE HEIGHT : This Inflatable Toddler Pillow Can Be Adjusted To 3 Different Heights To Meet Various Daily Life Needs. It Is Good Travel Accessories For Airplane. 3.ERGONOMIC + ADJUSTABLE DESIGN:  4.BREATHABLE FLOCKING PVC MATERIAL PACKAGE: A.Inflatable Footrest Travel Pillow *1 B.Earplugs *1 C.Eye Mask *1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618DS3ygHEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kimiandy","source_asin":"B0B5FBJLMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5FBJLMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5FBJLMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":211997,"name":"Frosted Privacy Window Film, No-Glue Stained Glass Window Decor/Privacy Protection/Heat Control/Anti UV, Iron Flower Stained Glass Static Cling for Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71alN1keqUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Notice: This No-glue film is only for smooth glass. Can not fit to frosted glass or art glass. Installation 1: Clean window (make sure your glass is clean and smooth);  2: Measure window and cut the film into required size; 3: Peel off the transparent backing film; 4: Wet both sides film. Wet glass (the more water, the better);  5: Paste the smooth side to glass; 6: Squeegee the film, squeegee away water and air bubbles; 7: Cut off excessive edges (leave a small gap about 2-3mm between the film and window to let water flow out). Q&A Q1: Too hard to remove the backing protective film, is there any tricks? A1: Take two pieces of tape and place them on opposite sides of the same corner. Make sure you cover the corner completely but leave some tape on each side to grab onto. When you pull the tape apart the film and the backing should separate from each other easily. Q2: Why my film does not stay? A2: Please don't forget to remove the transparent backing film, and then wet the window with clear water. Q3: I have removed the back film and wet the widow, why still can not stay? A3: You may apply the wrong side. The film is divided into two layers, one side is smooth, and the other side is rough. Please tear it off and retry the smooth side to paste again. Q4: There are a large number of small bubbles. A4: Too less water. Tear it down, spray a lot of water and paste it again. And then use a card to squeeze out all water and bubbles. Q5: Why the edge of my window film begins to fell off? A5: (1) The edge of film is too close to the window. Please leave a small gap (about 2-3 mm) to let the water flow out so that the film can stick well. (2) Too cold in winter. Please use a hair dryer to soften the film before applying under cold weather (Heat Resistant up to 176℉).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71alN1keqUL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAYBER","source_asin":"B09JJM4JC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-211997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JJM4JC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JJM4JC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
